{"action": "accept", "reason": "<one or two sentences>"}
{"action": "counter", "price": <your counteroffer, to 3 decimals>, "reason": "<one or two sentences>"}

```json
{"action": "counter", "price": 98.864, "reason": "The quote is close to my limit, but a counteroffer near the median dealer cost maximizes expected profit by balancing trade probability with potential savings."}
```

